{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用大顶堆维护较小的一半, 用小顶堆维护较大的一半, 并让两边元素数量之差不超过 1. 新数字先按堆顶分流, 再把多出的一项移到另一侧以恢复平衡. 两堆等大时取两个堆顶的平均值, 否则取元素较多一侧的堆顶, 插入时间为 O(log n), 查询中位数为 O(1), 总存储为 O(n).",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='zh-CN'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC',sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 4px}.intro{color:#8d8d8d;margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px}.stream,.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}.section-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}.numbers{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;text-align:center;background:#252526;transition:.35s}.cell .value{font:14px 'SF Mono',Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600}.cell .index{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}.heaps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}.heap-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:13px}.badge{font:10px 'SF Mono',Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#9cdcfe;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c}.heap-box{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:48px;padding:8px;border:1px dashed #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#1c1c1c}.heap-item{min-width:38px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;text-align:center;font:14px 'SF Mono',Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600}.heap-item.top{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.rule{margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.rule em{color:#3794ff;font-style:normal}.result{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}.action{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.detail{margin-top:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.median{text-align:center;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c}.median .label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.median .answer{font:13px 'SF Mono',Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff;font-weight:700}.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}.dot{height:3px;flex:1;border-radius:3px;background:#3c3c3c}.dot.on{background:#3794ff}@media(max-width:520px){.heaps,.result{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main><div class='title'>双堆动态维护中位数</div><div class='intro'>左侧大顶堆保存较小的一半, 右侧小顶堆保存较大的一半. 动画使用示例数据流 1 → 2 → 查询 → 3 → 查询.</div><section class='stream'><div class='section-label'>数据流与当前操作</div><div class='numbers' id='stream'></div></section><div class='heaps'><section class='panel'><div class='heap-title'><strong>较小的一半 · 大顶堆</strong><span class='badge' id='leftCount'>0 项</span></div><div class='heap-box' id='left'></div><div class='rule'>堆顶是左半部分的<em>最大值</em>, 是中位数候选.</div></section><section class='panel'><div class='heap-title'><strong>较大的一半 · 小顶堆</strong><span class='badge' id='rightCount'>0 项</span></div><div class='heap-box' id='right'></div><div class='rule'>堆顶是右半部分的<em>最小值</em>, 是中位数候选.</div></section></div><section class='result'><div><div class='action' id='action'></div><div class='detail' id='detail'></div></div><div class='median'><div class='label'>当前中位数</div><div class='answer' id='answer'>—</div></div></section><div class='progress' id='progress'></div></main><script>const steps=[{op:'初始化',left:[],right:[],answer:'—',detail:'两个堆均为空, 等待数据进入.',active:-1},{op:'addNum(1)',left:[1],right:[],answer:'1',detail:'大顶堆多 1 项, 直接取它的堆顶 1.',active:0},{op:'addNum(2)',left:[1],right:[2],answer:'—',detail:'2 大于左堆顶 1, 放入右侧小顶堆. 两边已经平衡.',active:1},{op:'findMedian()',left:[1],right:[2],answer:'1.5',detail:'两堆等大: (左堆顶 1 + 右堆顶 2) ÷ 2 = 1.5.',active:2},{op:'addNum(3)',left:[1],right:[2,3],answer:'—',detail:'3 进入右侧小顶堆; 两堆数量差为 1, 无须搬移.',active:3},{op:'findMedian()',left:[1],right:[2,3],answer:'2.0',detail:'右堆多 1 项, 中位数就是右侧小顶堆的堆顶 2.',active:4}];const labels=['1','2','查询','3','查询'];const stream=document.getElementById('stream');labels.forEach((v,i)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='cell';e.innerHTML=`<div class='value'>${v}</div><div class='index'>步骤 ${i+1}</div>`;stream.appendChild(e)});const progress=document.getElementById('progress');steps.forEach(()=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='dot';progress.appendChild(d)});function drawHeap(id,values){const box=document.getElementById(id);box.innerHTML='';if(!values.length){const e=document.createElement('span');e.style.color='#777';e.textContent='空';box.appendChild(e);return}values.forEach((v,i)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='heap-item'+(i===0?' top':'');e.innerHTML=`<div>${v}</div><div style='font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,PingFang SC,sans-serif;color:${i===0?'#fff':'#999'}'>${i===0?'堆顶':'堆内'}</div>`;box.appendChild(e)})}let index=0;function render(){const s=steps[index];drawHeap('left',s.left);drawHeap('right',s.right);document.getElementById('leftCount').textContent=s.left.length+' 项';document.getElementById('rightCount').textContent=s.right.length+' 项';document.getElementById('action').textContent='当前操作: '+s.op;document.getElementById('detail').textContent=s.detail;document.getElementById('answer').textContent=s.answer;[...stream.children].forEach((e,i)=>{e.className='cell'+(i===s.active?' active':i<s.active?' done':'')});[...progress.children].forEach((e,i)=>e.className='dot'+(i===index?' on':''));index=(index+1)%steps.length}render();setInterval(render,2200);</script></body></html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"插入 O(log n), 查询 O(1)","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为已插入的数据个数. addNum 包含堆插入与至多一次平衡搬移, findMedian 只读取堆顶; 两个堆合计保存全部 n 个数字."}
